WEBVTT

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:17.990
Odin has engaged the
Valkyrie Wing inside Fuji Pillar!

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:22.540
Minimal damage from Thor's hammer,
but Mjǫllnir is recharging!

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:25.410
There's just too many! At this rate--!

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:46.540
This is nothing!

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:47.490
Huh?

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:51.240
I'll say it again! This is nothing!

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:54.660
We've got Azu! We've got Sono! We've got Claudy!

00:00:54.660 --> 00:01:01.490
The whole world is fighting against you!
Apologize while you still can, Odie!

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:04.080
Apologize while I still can?!

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:08.490
What an infuriating daughter!
Can your spirit ever be broken?!

00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:09.410
Never!

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:10.290
Give it up!

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:11.950
Not a chance!

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:19.580
You're going down!

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:26.080
It's me you've gotta worry about, God Odin!

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:28.910
Why do you fight?! Witness my power!

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:31.790
Like Miyako said, "This is nothing"!

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:36.450
We came prepared to fight god!
Our wings don't fear you anymore!

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:42.830
Fight god?! You dare defy
your own father and blood, Claudia?!

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.830
Leave Odin to me! Continue as planned!

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:54.490
H-Hey! Continue as planned?!
It was kinda assumed you'd take on an S-Class!

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:55.370
Sono?!

00:01:55.370 --> 00:01:59.290
Miko, Azu! I'll manage this somehow!

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:01.700
But you're up against two Named!

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:03.870
Sono! It's all you!

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:10.870
Right! Don't worry about me, Azu!
I'm faster than anyone in the sky!

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:12.910
Don't crash or I'll cry!

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:14.700
That's quite a demand.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:16.200
That's Azu for you!

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.620
Hello girls!

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:18.540
Guys!

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:20.040
We finally caught up!

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:22.120
Good, the players are here!

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:24.700
C'mon, Azu! Let's do it!

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:29.200
Right! Time for a rematch against that big oaf!

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:07.370
Your bullets can't hit me!
You don't stand a chance! Why do you fight?!

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:12.790
Because if I hold you back,
Miyako, Azuzu, Sonoka...

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:16.660
Somebody will hit Thor in the face! That's why!

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:21.910
Somebody, you say?! You believe that nonsense?!

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:27.830
Can't you see you'll be the last alive
in a scorched battlefield, yet again?!

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:35.240
This is...

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:43.580
This is the future you're headed towards.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:49.290
The world consumed by flames...
Your friends and family, lost...

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:54.660
All alone, staring into the depths of despair.

00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:04.620
Sakura... Lily... Big Sis...
I always caused you guys problems.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:04.150
Don't be a baby, idiot!!

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:09.740
But today, I'm gonna make up for all of it!

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:11.740
Sondergerät!

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:15.240
Hero Cannon, fire!

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:21.990
That's all the firepower we've got.
If this doesn't work...

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:23.080
No way!

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.370
It didn't work?!

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:29.870
No, it did! That's why
it's starting to get serious!

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:31.990
But I'm outta ammo!

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:34.990
Don't start acting like a wimp on me!

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:38.240
No Open Flames

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:36.240
Boss!

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:39.370
There's a lever by your right leg. Pull it.

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:41.790
When did this get here?

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:45.240
What's that?!

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:48.740
Just a stupidly-big secret weapon.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:51.330
But why disguise it?!

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:54.330
Gotta fool your friends to fool the enemy.

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:55.290
Grr!

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.040
Thanks a bunch, Boss!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.160
No Open Flames

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:01.700
Yup. Don't you dare miss, Ki-44!

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:05.830
There's nobody. Nobody at all.

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:10.410
All the people precious to me are forever gone.

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:15.160
And you're no different.
At this rate, you'll be gone too.

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:20.660
Is this what you want?
This destruction?! A world like this?!

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:26.040
Of course it's not.
But I refuse to end up like you.

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:30.660
No, you will! Have you
not noticed, my daughter?!

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:33.830
Why did that song stay in your family?

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:38.160
Why is it only you survive
on the brutal battlefield?!

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:42.990
Why do you think I'm this
attached to only you?! Why?!

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:49.540
Because only in you does a god's blood flow.

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:52.080
Only you carry my blood.

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:55.790
I know you've felt something.

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:59.830
You know you're different
than others. You've felt it.

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:06.240
No person can heal your loneliness.
No one but me with whom you share blood.

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:09.450
Claudia, only you...

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:12.080
I finally understand, Odin.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:17.160
You're not a god who couldn't
acknowledge his defeat.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:24.450
You're a lone god desperately fighting solitude.

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:31.080
I'm a human. I was born
as one and will die as one.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:35.990
I cannot live as mythology!
I cannot live with you!

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:38.490
Claudia!

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:41.540
Have we located the Vandrande yet?

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:45.200
Not yet! The interference
is even stronger this time!

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:50.290
Shit! It's gotta be Thor.
That, or it's Odin's doing.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:54.990
That's...

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:07.830
Claudy's singing!
What a gentle song! It fills my heart!

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:11.790
It makes you wanna be with the people you love.

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:13.830
Kurumi! Coming through!

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:16.870
Nice!

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:17.790
Hear that?!

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:20.290
Yeah! It's Claudy's song!

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:28.120
Keep it up, Claudia!
Make our dumb dad hear your song!

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:33.700
Who gives a damn about
where it came from?! This song is yours!

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:36.620
The interference is weakening!

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:40.620
We've pinpointed the
coordinates of Fuji's Vandrande!

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.870
Nice! Komagome!

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:44.290
Copy that!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:49.490
But even if we know its location,
we've gotta do something about this guy!

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:53.330
Azu, go on! I'll take down Thor!

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:55.540
You know that's crazy, right?!

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:57.910
I know!

00:08:57.910 --> 00:09:00.740
I know that it's crazy!

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:05.330
The idiot's right.
There's nothing else we can do.

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:10.240
It'll take courage, but I'll get
the Vandrande while you get Thor.

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:13.490
I've got all the courage I need, right here!

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.910
Shield Squadron, cover Miyako!

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.830
Leave it to us!

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:21.870
Let's go!

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:24.370
Yeah!

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:28.580
Why, Claudia?!
Why do you fly towards your demise?!

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:35.160
I don't fly towards my demise.
I fly towards the revival that lies beyond!

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:46.740
The fang that vanquishes god, Tyrfing...
You intend to use your last on me?

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:53.910
No!

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:55.540
I'm sorry.

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:19.330
How dare you! How dare you!

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:22.990
Don't think you can dodge my spear, Gungnir!

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:26.290
It never fails to destroy my enemies!

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:32.290
You used all the Tyrfing I gave you! Yet, why?!

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:36.790
It's your death! It's your ruin!
Do you not fear loneliness?!

00:10:36.790 --> 00:10:40.160
I fear death. I'm afraid of ruin.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:44.870
But I don't want to lose my friends and family.

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:04.120
Goodbye, Father.

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:18.620
I've only got one shot!
I can't afford to miss! I've gotta get through!

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:23.450
Miko, don't worry about the storm!
Fly straight through to Thor!

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:24.330
Guys!

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:27.120
No worries! We'll keep you safe!

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:30.120
Believe in us!

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:31.870
All right.

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:34.370
You'll risk your lives for me?

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:36.660
Yup! If it's for Miko...

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:38.040
No questions asked!

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:40.290
Yeah! Flying is life!

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:42.990
Thank god we were born dudes!

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:47.120
Almost there... A little more!

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:48.540
Now!

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:58.620
Sakura... Thank you for
protecting the skies of Japan.

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:08.160
You managed not to cry this time.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:09.830
You proud of me?

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:13.580
Yeah. I'm proud of you, Sister.

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:16.870
Me too.

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:18.490
I'm proud of...

00:12:55.450 --> 00:13:00.370
Hero Cannon, fire!

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:29.910
This is... the core of the Pillar?

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:31.540
Then, that's the--!

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:34.580
You've done well to reach here.

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:39.290
Splendid. You're not Claudia, nor even a Named.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:43.490
I'm impressed a human made it this far.

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:46.200
If you're here, where's Claudy?

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:50.950
You're a smart one.
You should know without saying.

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:54.950
And it's not just Claudia. Many have died.

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:57.580
Why do you continue fighting?

00:13:57.580 --> 00:14:02.620
You lost your friends, your allies...
And for what?

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:05.950
How about you ask yourself the same question?

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:12.990
Face the facts. Isn't it about time
you acted like a proper god for once?

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:17.580
No. I won't acknowledge it.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:19.450
Odin!

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:23.240
Why must a god behave honorably?

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:27.120
Must they graciously welcome their own ruin?

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:32.120
Doesn't everyone want to protect what they love?

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:38.660
My wife, my children, my friends...
I don't want to lose anyone!

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:42.330
I refuse to lose anything!

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:47.660
Surely, you're out of moves now.

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:52.740
All that's left is to add
your friends outside to my army.

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:56.490
And then, the decisive battle...

00:14:56.490 --> 00:15:01.910
Why stand? You're such a stubborn daughter.

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:04.290
Do you have another plan?

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:10.410
As if. Not even I can plan
my way out of this pickle.

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:13.450
It's just, I believe...

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:18.040
I believe in what saves me
whenever I'm in a pinch.

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:19.660
Meaning?

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:23.240
I believe my hero will come!

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:40.330
It can't be! That was your goal?!

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:55.290
You...

00:15:56.910 --> 00:16:00.370
What's the difference between you and me?

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:04.700
I resisted my destruction doing all I could.

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:07.370
Yet, it wasn't enough.

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:12.950
Tell me. What's the difference
between you and me?

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:17.620
You're alone.

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:22.370
You tried to carry it alone.
You should've asked for help!

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:32.160
Foolish daughter. I always had
a hard time with you and your kindness.

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:49.870
That's...

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.950
That light...!

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:08.950
N-No longer detecting Fuji Primary Pillar!

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:14.700
And the Tertiary Pillars are dropping
like flies! Does this mean--?!

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:18.370
Assess the situation.

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:18.850
Huh?

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:22.870
Let's rescue casualties and get a damage report.

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:28.450
Find out how the battles are
progressing worldwide. Hurry up.

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:29.270
R-Right!

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:30.410
Right!

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:36.490
It's too early to celebrate,
but once we wrap things up... Huh?

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:52.620
That's--!

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:54.160
They all made it!

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:57.620
Hell yeah!

00:17:57.620 --> 00:17:59.700
Uh, erm...

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:04.330
That was... Ahem! What I meant was... Status?

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:07.370
Tateyama's Valkyrie Wing: All craft, safe!

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:10.490
All domestic battles have ceased!

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:13.490
Primaries worldwide have gone dormant!

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:18.330
All fighting has ceased! Commander!

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:22.790
Operation Ragnarök 2 is complete.

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:24.740
Humanity is victorious!

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:27.120
Yeah!

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.040
Woohoo!

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:12.910
We will carry on the spirit
of the Shield Squadron.

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:14.290
Let's get to it!

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.580
What's first?

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:16.740
Soccer!

00:19:16.740 --> 00:19:18.370
Let's race to the field!

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:19.620
I'll grab a ball!

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:21.240
The kids there yet?!

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:25.740
The noisy ones are gone,
but the base hasn't changed at all.

00:19:25.740 --> 00:19:28.700
We've got them to thank for that.

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:32.040
We loved this base because they were part of it.

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:35.580
Those sent off by Valkyries become heroes.

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:40.910
And reunite somewhere new
with the people they love, right?

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:43.410
You think they have already?

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:46.830
This is reality, not a fairy-tale.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:52.700
But, seeing how there're gods
and we fight with mysterious power,

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:55.790
not to mention one of us has god's blood,

00:19:55.790 --> 00:20:00.240
I think fairy-tales
being true isn't so far-fetched.

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:02.580
They're not the hero-type, though.

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:04.450
Now you've said too much.

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:05.700
That's so Azuzu.

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:06.740
Excuse me?!

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:13.200
I can picture 'em saying,
"We ain't no heroes!" and laughing.

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:16.540
You guys were the coolest ever!

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:24.870
I love you guys, you big idiots!

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:29.870
Thank you. See ya.

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:37.660
Well, we retook Mt. Fuji
and Odin seems to have vanished.

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:41.080
But there's still
Primary Pillars around the world...

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:44.200
...and the threat of Secondaries remains.

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:45.160
Um...

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:46.370
What?

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:49.660
Should you be doing that
during a serious discussion?

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:55.330
Well, you see, I haven't
had much time to cut 'em lately.

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:58.700
That's smart of you. It hurts when they snag.

00:20:58.700 --> 00:21:00.660
Can you not defend him?

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:03.120
Anyways, it's nice to have you here.

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:05.660
We can give you a base tour, but someone--

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:07.740
Me, me, me!

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:11.660
Us four will do it!

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:13.830
Shit. This is embarrassing.

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:18.990
Oh, please! We all know
you wanted to! Don't lie!

00:21:18.990 --> 00:21:21.160
Oh? Look who came!

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:23.330
They officially join today?!

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:25.580
Lucky us! Lucky us!

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:30.950
Okay, that's enough! No harassing
my cute juniors! Shoo! Shoo!

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:33.160
Aww! You're so mean, Sono!

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:37.330
Hey brats! If you've got
time to chitchat, get busy!

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:38.830
Yeah.

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:40.870
Um, we're starting today, and--

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:42.490
Don't know! Don't care!

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:43.160
Huh?

00:21:43.160 --> 00:21:46.660
I'll keep her in tip-top shape for you.

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:49.490
Push her to the limit.

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:51.830
He's got high hopes for you.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:53.120
Really?

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:54.120
That's right.

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:56.120
Shuddap, Gladiator!

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:57.490
L-Let's run!

00:21:57.490 --> 00:21:57.960
Huh?!

00:21:57.960 --> 00:21:59.870
Run where?!

00:22:05.490 --> 00:22:08.620
Claudia Bruford. Ready for takeoff.

00:22:08.620 --> 00:22:11.330
Sonoka Watarai. I'm good.

00:22:11.330 --> 00:22:13.870
Azuzu Komagome. Standing by.

00:22:13.870 --> 00:22:16.830
Miyako Muguruma. Ready to go!

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:19.290
Moe Isurugi! Reporting for duty!

00:22:19.290 --> 00:22:24.200
Huh? U-Um... Kurumi Suzuhara! I'm in your hands!

00:22:30.490 --> 00:22:33.040
Welcome to Tateyama Base!

00:22:33.040 --> 00:22:40.040
Final Episode

00:22:33.040 --> 00:22:40.040
Welcome to Tateyama Base!!
